{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hab-2-1","title":"Habakkuk 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Unto Habakkuk, waiting for an answer, is shewn that he must wait by faith. 5 The judgment upon the Chaldean for unsatiableness, 9 for covetousness, 12 for cruelty, 15 for drunkenness, 18 and for idolatry.</p>\n<p>stand. Ps 73:16,17; Isa 21:8,11,12 tower. Heb. fenced place. 2Sa 18:24; 2Ki 9:17; 17:9; Isa 21:5; 62:6 and will. 1:12-17; Ps 85:8 unto me. or, in me. 2Co 13:3; Ga 1:16 when I am reproved. or, when I am argued with. Heb. upon myreproof, or arguing. Job 23:5-7; 31:35,37; Jer 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-2","title":"Habakkuk 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Write. De 27:8; 31:19,22; Isa 8:1; 30:8; Jer 36:2-4,27-32; Da 12:4 Re 1:18,19; 14:13; 19:9; 21:5-8 make. Joh 11:28,29; 1Co 14:19; 2Co 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-3","title":"Habakkuk 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the vision. Jer 27:7; Da 8:19; 9:24-27; 10:1,14; 11:27,35; Ac 1:7; 17:26; Ga 4:2 2Th 2:6-8 but. Ex 12:41; Ps 102:13; Jer 25:12-14; Heb 10:36 wait. 2Ki 6:33; Ps 27:14; 130:5,6; Isa 30:18; La 3:25,26; Mic 7:7; Lu 2:25 Jas 5:7,8 it will surely. Lu 18:7,8; 2Pe 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-4","title":"Habakkuk 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>his. Job 40:11,12; Da 4:30,37; 5:20-23; Lu 18:14; 2Th 2:4; 1Pe 5:5 but. Joh 3:36; Ro 1:17; Ga 2:16; 3:11,12; Heb 10:38; 1Jo 5:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-5","title":"Habakkuk 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Yea also. or, How much more. he transgresseth. Pr 20:1; 23:29-33; 31:4,5; Isa 5:11,12,22,23; 21:5; Jer 51:39 Da 5:1-4,23; Na 1:9,10 a proud man. 4; Ps 138:6; Pr 30:13,14; Isa 2:11,12,17; 16:6; Jer 50:29 Da 5:20-23; Jas 4:6 keepeth. 2Ki 14:10; 1Th 4:11; *Gr: who. Isa 5:8; 10:7-13 as hell. Pr 27:20; 30:15,16; Ec 5:10 gathereth. 8-10; Isa 14:16,17; Jer 25:9,17-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-6","title":"Habakkuk 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>take. Nu 23:7,18; Isa 14:4-19; Jer 29:22; 50:13; Eze 32:21; Mic 2:4 Woe to him. or, Ho, he. that increaseth. 1:9,10,15; Job 20:15-29; 22:6-10; Pr 22:16; Jer 51:34,35; Jas 5:1-4 how. Ps 94:3; Lu 12:20; 1Co 7:29-31; 1Pe 4:7 ladeth. 13; Isa 44:20; 55:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-7","title":"Habakkuk 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>they. Pr 29:1; Isa 13:1-5,16-18; 21:2-9; 41:25; 45:1-3; 46:11; 47:11 Isa 48:14,15; Jer 50:21-32; 51:11,27,28,57; Da 5:25-31; Na 1:9,10 1Th 5:3 bite. Ec 10:8; Jer 8:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-8","title":"Habakkuk 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thou. 10,17; Isa 33:1,4; Jer 27:7; 30:16; 50:10,37; 51:13,44,48,55,56 Zec 2:8,9 blood. Heb. bloods. 17 the violence. Ps 137:8; Isa 47:6; Jer 50:11,17,18,28,33,34; 51:8,24,34,35 Mic 4:11-13; Zec 1:15; 2:8; 12:2-4; 14:12; Re 6:10; 18:20-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-9","title":"Habakkuk 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that coveteth an evil covetousness. or, that gaineth an evilgain. Ge 13:10-13; 19:26-38; De 7:25,26; Jos 7:21-26; 1Ki 21:2-4,19-24 2Ki 5:20-27; Job 20:19-28; Jer 22:13-19; Zec 5:1-4; Ac 1:17-25 Jude 1:11 set. Ps 10:3-6; 49:11; 52:7; Pr 18:11,12; Isa 28:15; 47:7-9; Jer 49:16 Ob 1:4 power of evil. Heb. palm of the hand.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-10","title":"Habakkuk 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>consulted. 2Ki 9:26; 10:7; Isa 14:20-22; Jer 22:30; 36:31; Na 1:14; Mt 27:25 sinned. Nu 16:38; 1Ki 2:23; Pr 1:18; 8:36; Isa 33:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-11","title":"Habakkuk 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the stone. Ge 4:10; Jos 24:27; Job 31:38-40; Lu 19:40; Heb 12:24; Jas 5:3,4 Re 6:10 beam. or, piece. or, fastening. answer it. or, witnessagainst it.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-12","title":"Habakkuk 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>him. Ge 4:11-17; Jos 6:26; 1Ki 16:34; Jer 22:13-17; Eze 24:9; Da 4:27-31 Mic 3:10; Na 3:1; Joh 11:47-50; Re 17:6 blood. Heb. bloods. 8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-13","title":"Habakkuk 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>is it. Ge 11:6-9; 2Sa 15:31; Job 5:13,14; Ps 39:6; 127:1,2; Pr 21:30 Isa 41:5-8; 50:11; 55:2; Jer 51:58,64; Mal 1:4 for very vanity. or, in vain.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-14","title":"Habakkuk 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the earth. Ps 22:27; 67:1,2; 72:19; 86:9; 98:1-3; Isa 6:3; 11:9; Zec 14:8,9 Re 11:15; 15:4 with the knowledge of the glory. or, by knowing the glory.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-15","title":"Habakkuk 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>unto. Ge 19:32-35; 2Sa 11:13; 13:26-28; Jer 25:15; 51:7; Re 17:2,6; 18:3 that puttest. Ho 7:5 that thou. Ge 9:22; Ex 32:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-16","title":"Habakkuk 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>with shame for glory. or, more with shame than with glory. Pr 3:35; Isa 47:3; Ho 4:7; Php 3:19 drink. Ps 75:8; Isa 49:26; 51:21-23; Jer 25:26,27; 51:57; Re 18:6 and let. Isa 20:4; 47:3; Na 3:5 the cup. Jer 25:27-29 and shameful. Isa 28:7,8; Ho 7:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-17","title":"Habakkuk 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the violence. Zec 11:1 because. 8; Ps 55:23; 137:8; Pr 28:17; Re 18:20-24 of the city. Jer 50:28,33,34; 51:24,34-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-18","title":"Habakkuk 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>profiteth. Isa 37:38; 42:17; 44:9,10; 45:16,20; 46:1,2,6-8; Jer 2:27,28; 10:3-5 Jer 50:2; Ro 6:21 a teacher. Jer 10:8,14,15; Jon 2:8; Zec 10:2; Ro 1:23-25; 2Th 2:9-11 1Ti 4:1,2; Re 13:11-15; 19:20 that the. Ps 115:4-8; 135:15-18; Isa 1:31; 44:14-20 maker of his work. Heb. fashioner of his fashion. dumb. 1Co 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-19","title":"Habakkuk 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>that. 1Ki 18:26-29; Ps 97:7; Isa 44:17; Jer 51:47; Da 3:7,18,29; 5:23 Jon 1:5 it is. Isa 40:19; 46:6; Jer 10:4,9; Da 3:1; Ac 17:29; Re 17:4 and there. Ps 135:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hab-2-20","title":"Habakkuk 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HAB","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the Lord. Ps 11:4; 115:3; 132:13,14; Isa 6:1; 66:1,6; Jon 2:4,7; Eph 2:21,22 let all the earth keep silence before him. Heb. be silent allthe earth before him. Ps 46:10; 76:8,9; Zep 1:7; Zec 2:13</p>"}]}